# Flask CI/CD with GitHub Actions & Docker

This is a simple Flask web app that demonstrates a DevOps pipeline using:

- Python & Flask
- Docker
- GitHub Actions (CI/CD)
- Linting with flake8

## 🔧 CI/CD Flow
1. Lint the code
2. Build the Docker image
3. (Optional) Push the image to Docker Hub

## 🛠️ To Run Locally
```bash
docker build -t flask-ci-cd .
docker run -p 5000:5000 flask-ci-cd
